{"blocks":[["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2331","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/01 as Soundgen — the 5.0 manual's C−2 to G8 for MIDI 0 to 127 shows that Arturia names MIDI 60 C3.",["Octave key range reference","Sources"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2467","Recorded sessions",["Octave key range reference"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2491","GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun at 05:15 — Microfreak/Preset/259 Infini Pad with the OLED at -2, as codekiln noted. The keys send G1 (31) and F1 (29), inside the -2 row.",["Octave key range reference","Recorded sessions"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2671","GitP/A/Session/26/10/29-Thu at 10:32 — Microfreak/Preset/138 Metallic Talk, saved at -2, opens on the keys with G1 (31) and F1 (29), inside the -2 row.",["Octave key range reference","Recorded sessions"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2837","GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun at 18:22 — Microfreak/Preset/260 8bitfi, saved at +2, opens with C6 to E6 (84 to 88), inside the +2 row.",["Octave key range reference","Recorded sessions"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-2984","GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun at 01:59 — Infini Pad, saved at 0, plays G5 to C6 (79 to 84), which sits in the +1 row. An Octave Up press before 01:59 would account for it; the MIDI does not record octave button presses.",["Octave key range reference","Recorded sessions"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-3212","Uncertainty",["Octave key range reference"]],["Microfreak/UI/Front/Row/03%20Bottom/01%20Octave/Ref/Key%20Range/","source-block-3230","Arturia publishes no note number for any single key. The table reads the 1.0 manual's C−1 to C7 in the naming the 5.0 manual uses.",[